<metadata><name>Galičica trail G-5</name><desc>G-5 is one of Galičica National Park's high ridge trails above 1,600 m. It's 10.1 km from the T-4 junction to Galičica pass (Lipova Livada), with about 658 m of climbing and 630 m of descent in the direction drawn, between 1,542 m and 1,975 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/g-5/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
